  texto: {fileID: 1980136210}
  lineasDialogo:
  - Gabriel was here this afternoon. He was talking to someone, but I didn't get
    a good look at who it was.
  - When I turned around, they were both gone.
  ispista: 1
  pistaTexto: Gabriel was with someone before he died.
